cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use autoMBIST in academic or professional work, please cite it as below."
title: autoMBIST
abstract: >-
  An open-source, OpenRAM-integrated Memory Built-In Self-Test (MBIST) generator
  with built-in redundancy analysis (BIRA) and self-repair (BISR), plus a
  programmable march-algorithm and functional-fault-model research platform.
  Proven through open RTL-to-GDS closure on sky130 via the LibreLane flow.
type: software
